mbined Geo-Scientist 2027 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 127 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Geologist Group A (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">29</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Geophysicist Group A (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">00</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chemist Group A&nbsp;(Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">07</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Geologist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">34</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Geophysicist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">35</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Chemist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">06</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist B (Hydrogeology)&nbsp;Group A&nbsp;(Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">05</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist B (Chemical)&nbsp;Group A&nbsp;(Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist B (Geophysics) Group A (Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Hydrogeologist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">07</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Chemist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Geophysicist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSC Combined Geo-Scientist Recruitment 2027 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Geologist Group A (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Passed / Appearing Master Degree Geological&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"google-anno-t\">Science</span>&nbsp;or Geology or Applied Geology or Geo-Exploration or Mineral Exploration or Engineering Geology or Marine Geology or Earth Science or Any Other Equivalent Degree</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Geophysicist Group A (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates Passed / Appearing Master Degree in Science in Following Stream Physics / Applied Physics / Geophysics / Marine Geophysics or Any Other Equivalent Degree</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chemist Group A&nbsp;(Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master Degree in Science M.Sc Chemistry / Applied Chemistry / Analytical Chemistry Passed / Appearing in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Geologist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s degree or Integrated Master’s degree in Geology or Applied Geology or Mineral Exploration or Marine Geology or Earth Science from a recognized University or Institute.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Geophysicist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Science or Integrated Master of Science in Chemistry or Applied Chemistry or Analytical Chemistry or Physical Chemistry or Inorganic Chemistry or Organic Chemistry or Hydro-Chemistry or Industrial Chemistry from a recognized university or institute.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Chemist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-I)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Science or Integrated Master of Science in Chemistry or Applied Chemistry or Analytical Chemistry or Physical Chemistry or Inorganic Chemistry or Organic Chemistry or Hydro-Chemistry or Industrial Chemistry from a recognized university or institute.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist B (Hydrogeology)&nbsp;Group A&nbsp;(Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates Passed / Appearing (Final Year) Master degree in Geology or Applied Geology or Marine Geology or Any Equivalent Degree in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist B (Chemical)&nbsp;Group A&nbsp;(Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates Passed / Appearing (Final Year) Master degree in Geology or Applied Geology or Marine Geology or Any Equivalent Degree in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist B (Geophysics) Group A (Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates Passed / Appearing (Final Year) Master degree in Geology or Applied Geology or Marine Geology or Any Equivalent Degree in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Hydrogeologist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s degree in Geology or applied Geology or Marine Geology or Hydrogeology from a Recognized University.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Chemist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Science or Integrated Master of Science in Chemistry or Applied Chemistry or Analytical Chemistry or Physical Chemistry or Inorganic Chemistry or Organic Chemistry or Hydro-Chemistry or Industrial Chemistry from a recognized university or institute.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9008%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Geophysicist, Group ‘B’ (Cat-II)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0992%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Science or Integrated Master of Science in Chemistry or Applied Chemistry or Analytical Chemistry or Physical Chemistry or Inorganic Chemistry or Organic Chemistry or Hydro-Chemistry or Industrial Chemistry from a recognized university or institute.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSC Combined Geo-Scientist Online Form 2027 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Personality Test </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSC Combined Geo Scientist Recruitment 2027 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://upsc.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the UPSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other &nbsp;Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for UPSC Geo-Scientist recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे ।</